{"content_hash": "b55c532962162cd6", "version_id": 803, "article_id": 81, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Farming Simulator 25 adds coffee and alpacas in new paid DLC", "title_zh": "《模拟农场25》新付费DLC上线，这次能种咖啡养羊驼", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221607", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612287230202-1ff1d85d1bdf?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZGxjJTIwdmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY29udHJvbGxlcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzMjM2MjEzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Javier Martínez on Unsplash", "author": "Javier Martínez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cjdante?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/game-controller-in-neon-light-hUD0PUczwJQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "5ab094f0a0ba"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-29", "word_count": 212, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Sega has released a new paid expansion for Farming Simulator 25 called Beans & Alpacas. It takes players to a South American farm where they can grow coffee and raise alpacas.", "lead_zh": "世嘉为《模拟农场25》推出了名为“Beans & Alpacas”的新付费扩展包，带玩家走进南美农场，在那里可以种咖啡、养羊驼。", "preview": "The DLC is out now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac, and a launch trailer came with it. The new map is called Catuaí, a green v", "preview_zh": "该DLC现已登陆PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC和Mac平台，上线宣传片也同步公开。新地图名为卡杜艾，是一片以巴西咖啡产区为灵感的翠绿山谷，有红土、狭窄道路和蜿蜒河流，玩家还能参观博物馆或森林研究设施。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 787, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 76.55, "size_bytes": 460224, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 78.7, "size_bytes": 473184, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 83.425, "size_bytes": 501552, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 71.525, "size_bytes": 430128, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 78.375, "size_bytes": 471168, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5eaba37/content/data/versions/803.json", "paragraphs": ["The DLC is out now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac, and a launch trailer came with it. The new map is called Catuaí, a green valley inspired by Brazil's coffee regions. It has red soil, narrow roads and winding rivers, and players can also visit a museum or a forest research site.", "Two new crops arrive with the pack: coffee and bananas. Because coffee needs drying and roasting buildings, and bananas need washing equipment and transport rails, players can turn their harvest into products like tiramisu and banana chips. Alpacas are new too, and you can walk them to raise their happiness or shear them once a year.", "Alpaca wool can be sold directly, although it can also become yarn, socks, pillows or toys. The pack adds Brahman cattle and wild animals such as parrots and harmless caimans. More than 25 new machines appear, and the brands Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders join the series for the first time.", "Beans & Alpacas is sold alone or inside the Year 2 Season Pass, which costs less than buying each piece separately. A special edition that includes the base game is also available, and the full game offers four regions and over 400 machines from more than 150 real brands."], "paragraphs_zh": ["该DLC现已登陆PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC和Mac平台，上线宣传片也同步公开。新地图名为卡杜艾，是一片以巴西咖啡产区为灵感的翠绿山谷，有红土、狭窄道路和蜿蜒河流，玩家还能参观博物馆或森林研究设施。", "这个扩展包带来两种新作物：咖啡和香蕉。因为咖啡需要干燥和烘焙设施，香蕉需要清洗设备和运输滑轨，所以玩家能把收成加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品。羊驼也是新内容，你可以带它们散步来提升幸福度，或每年剪一次毛。", "羊驼毛可以直接出售，不过也能加工成毛线、袜子、枕头或玩偶。扩展包还新增婆罗门牛，以及鹦鹉、不咬人的凯门鳄等野生动物。超过25种新农机登场，Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders两个品牌首次加入本系列。", "“Beans & Alpacas”可单独购买，也收录在第二年季票中，买季票比逐项购买更便宜。包含游戏正篇的特别版也已发售，完整游戏提供四个地区，以及来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机。"], "body": "The DLC is out now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac, and a launch trailer came with it. The new map is called Catuaí, a green valley inspired by Brazil's coffee regions. It has red soil, narrow roads and winding rivers, and players can also visit a museum or a forest research site.\n\nTwo new crops arrive with the pack: coffee and bananas. Because coffee needs drying and roasting buildings, and bananas need washing equipment and transport rails, players can turn their harvest into products like tiramisu and banana chips. Alpacas are new too, and you can walk them to raise their happiness or shear them once a year.\n\nAlpaca wool can be sold directly, although it can also become yarn, socks, pillows or toys. The pack adds Brahman cattle and wild animals such as parrots and harmless caimans. More than 25 new machines appear, and the brands Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders join the series for the first time.\n\nBeans & Alpacas is sold alone or inside the Year 2 Season Pass, which costs less than buying each piece separately. A special edition that includes the base game is also available, and the full game offers four regions and over 400 machines from more than 150 real brands.", "body_zh": "该DLC现已登陆PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC和Mac平台，上线宣传片也同步公开。新地图名为卡杜艾，是一片以巴西咖啡产区为灵感的翠绿山谷，有红土、狭窄道路和蜿蜒河流，玩家还能参观博物馆或森林研究设施。\n\n这个扩展包带来两种新作物：咖啡和香蕉。因为咖啡需要干燥和烘焙设施，香蕉需要清洗设备和运输滑轨，所以玩家能把收成加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品。羊驼也是新内容，你可以带它们散步来提升幸福度，或每年剪一次毛。\n\n羊驼毛可以直接出售，不过也能加工成毛线、袜子、枕头或玩偶。扩展包还新增婆罗门牛，以及鹦鹉、不咬人的凯门鳄等野生动物。超过25种新农机登场，Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders两个品牌首次加入本系列。\n\n“Beans & Alpacas”可单独购买，也收录在第二年季票中，买季票比逐项购买更便宜。包含游戏正篇的特别版也已发售，完整游戏提供四个地区，以及来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机。", "text": "The DLC is out now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC and Mac, and a launch trailer came with it. The new map is called Catuaí, a green valley inspired by Brazil's coffee regions. It has red soil, narrow roads and winding rivers, and players can also visit a museum or a forest research site. Two new crops arrive with the pack: coffee and bananas. Because coffee needs drying and roasting buildings, and bananas need washing equipment and transport rails, players can turn their harvest into products like tiramisu and banana chips. Alpacas are new too, and you can walk them to raise their happiness or shear them once a year. Alpaca wool can be sold directly, although it can also become yarn, socks, pillows or toys. The pack adds Brahman cattle and wild animals such as parrots and harmless caimans. More than 25 new machines appear, and the brands Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders join the series for the first time. Beans & Alpacas is sold alone or inside the Year 2 Season Pass, which costs less than buying each piece separately. A special edition that includes the base game is also available, and the full game offers four regions and over 400 machines from more than 150 real brands.", "vocab": [{"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩展包", "note": "游戏里常指新增内容的付费包", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trailer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "宣传片；预告片", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inspired by", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "以……为灵感", "note": "常用被动形式 be inspired by", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "harvest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "收成；收获", "note": "也可作动词表示收割", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shear", "pos": "verb", "zh": "剪（羊毛）", "note": "过去式 sheared", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "directly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "直接地", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "harmless", "pos": "adj", "zh": "无害的", "note": "harm 加后缀 -less", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "for the first time", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "首次", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "separately", "pos": "adv", "zh": "单独地", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "base game", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏正篇；本体", "note": "与DLC相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:10.588590", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "DLC", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.9, "sm": 350, "em": 900, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.025, "sm": 900, "em": 1024, "cs": 8, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "out", "s": 1.025, "e": 1.225, "sm": 1025, "em": 1224, "cs": 11, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "now", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.437, "sm": 1225, "em": 1437, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "on", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1437, "em": 1550, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "PlayStation", "s": 1.55, "e": 2.175, "sm": 1550, "em": 2174, "cs": 22, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "5", "s": 2.175, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2175, "em": 2750, "cs": 34, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ",", "s": 2.75, "e": 2.85, "sm": 2750, "em": 2850, "cs": 35, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "Xbox", "s": 2.85, "e": 3.375, "sm": 2850, "em": 337